00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:28,240
Fast Forward wins with a score of sixty nine point five.

142
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:31,100
When a human worker steps within one point one meters,

143
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:35,600
Stop and Wait wins immediately with forty nine point five, protecting the worker.

144
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,860
And when battery drops to fourteen percent,

145
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:42,070
Go Charge wins with sixty eight point zero so the robot never gets stranded.

